{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["And the meaning of <b>and a man or a woman.</b> Because he said concerning the ovot, that they defile with them, he said: you shall be holy, and you shall put to death whoever defiles himself with an ov and a yidoni — for until now he has not mentioned punishment for one who turns to an ov publicly. And the reason for mentioning the woman is that this craft is more in the hands of women, and likewise: a sorceress you shall not keep alive."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:27.311956100Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}